Welcome to Human Design Chart!

This App is Your personal advisor to Human Design — a unique combination of research, experience and techniques from world certified specialists, aimed to identify, evince and explain the uniqueness of each person and giving recommendations for the career, relationships, family building, nutrition and wellbeing.

This comprehensive system of Human Design knowledge and methods will help you reach the state of awareness and understanding of yourself and others, the causes of events in your life and their consequences.

How App works :

* Builds your personal Rave Chart (Bodygraph) to delve into the depths of your unique energy blueprint and provide a comprehensive understanding of your strengths, challenges, and potential;
* Gathers information from official Human Design database to ensure accuracy and reliability in delivering precise insights that can guide you towards a life of fulfillment and purpose;
* Customizes your life journey map to help you tailor goals, aspirations, and actions based on the wisdom embedded in your Human Design;
* Decodes your true self and life purposes to empower you to make conscious choices that align with your authentic nature;
* Creates unique daily advices and affirmations for you to start each day with a powerful message tailored specifically to your Human Design;
* Generates recommendations for career, relationships, nutrition and wellbeing, leveraging the insights gained from your Human Design to help you thrive in all areas of your life.


Don't know what to begin with? There is no better time than now to start your exciting discovery with Human Design App and get acquainted with true yourself.




